      "writtenOn": "2026-07-06T10:29:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure I get the question? People would need to go to sessionize to propose their talk, it would then be us finding them a spot in the schedule.\n\nI can see if sessionize as some sort of integration though.",
