      "writtenOn": "2026-07-06T14:06:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t believe we need the complexity of integrating Sessionize with our homepage. We use it for collecting the talk requests, and that\u0027s it. What additional integration would add as a benefit? At what cost of complexity?",
      "parentUuid": "7b0b6600_659f0da4",
      "revId": "5dc339bf6a19d290db0684eff0a384b66a5d7011",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52fb11b9_2310c3c6",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1155599
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-13T09:24:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sessionize let\u0027s you create the schedule in Sessionize and then they provide an embeddable iframe, so you\u0027d only need to update sessionize and not even redeploy the website.\n\nI think that provides quite a good benefit for very little complexity.",
      "parentUuid": "75cb3668_79d94bd2",
      "revId": "5dc339bf6a19d290db0684eff0a384b66a5d7011",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8d591fbd_bc2f9415",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
