      "writtenOn": "2026-07-13T10:42:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Honestly, I believe even a simple form to submit the proposals would have been good enough. As @danielesassoli@gmail.com has already setup sessionize, we can use it to get proposals.\n\nWith regards to using it inside an iframe, I don\u0027t believe it\u0027s good as it may disappear overnight, and we\u0027ll lose the historical view of what the schedule was in a few years from now.\n\nOnce the RFP is done, we can just get the schedule into the website.",
      "parentUuid": "52fb11b9_2310c3c6",
      "revId": "5dc339bf6a19d290db0684eff0a384b66a5d7011",
